<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:10.200" end="00:00:14.000" style="s2">Baby.</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.700" end="00:00:16.600" style="s2">Baby seems to be waking up.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.000" end="00:00:16.600" style="s2">I&#39;ll go check.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.200" end="00:00:25.300" style="s2">It&#39;s only been a few years</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.100" end="00:00:28.400" style="s2">she went and made the young master a</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.300" end="00:00:28.400" style="s2">cuckold like that.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.600" end="00:00:33.900" style="s2">Grandpa, he&#39;s still just a little kid.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.800" end="00:00:38.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, it doesn&#39;t matter anymore whether</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.500" end="00:00:40.600" style="s2">you were the one who set the fire seven</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.200" end="00:00:43.400" style="s2">years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.600" end="00:00:43.400" style="s2">Can we start over?</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.800" end="00:00:51.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Justin.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.800" end="00:00:51.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.800" end="00:00:56.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could Zach be your son?</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.300" end="00:00:57.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have looked into it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.300" end="00:00:59.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What have you found out? Have you done a</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.400" end="00:01:01.800" style="s2">DNA test? Could it be that Chloe made up</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.800" end="00:01:03.500" style="s2">the whole story to fool us, afraid you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.800" end="00:01:05.300" style="s2">fight her for the child?</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.500" end="00:01:06.600" style="s2">She&#39;s had feelings for you for years.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.300" end="00:01:08.300" style="s2">How could she have changed your mind</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.600" end="00:01:09.700" style="s2">right after going to White?</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.300" end="00:01:10.600" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me nothing happened between</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.700" end="00:01:12.000" style="s2">you two.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.600" end="00:01:13.800" style="s2">I slipped something into your drink</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.000" end="00:01:15.600" style="s2">right before Chloe left.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.800" end="00:01:17.600" style="s2">I even kept it from her and sent her to</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.600" end="00:01:19.800" style="s2">the hotel to meet you. There&#39;s no way</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.600" end="00:01:21.100" style="s2">you could have kept your self-control.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.800" end="00:01:21.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were the one who drugged me that</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.100" end="00:01:23.700" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.800" end="00:01:26.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep your voice down. Do you want Chloe</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.700" end="00:01:27.500" style="s2">to hear us?</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.000" end="00:01:29.600" style="s2">If you just give me a grandson, I</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.500" end="00:01:32.100" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t even be meddling in your life.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.600" end="00:01:33.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I made her take contraceptive pills.</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.100" end="00:01:35.800" style="s2">Zach isn&#39;t my son.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.700" end="00:01:37.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s no wonder Chloe is walking out on</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.800" end="00:01:41.200" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.300" end="00:01:41.200" style="s2">You&#39;re absolutely heartless.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.600" end="00:01:47.800" style="s2">Birth control pills aren&#39;t 100%</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.700" end="00:01:47.800" style="s2">effective. Go get this sorted out.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.800" end="00:01:52.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.351" end="00:01:53.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.500" end="00:01:54.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The baby&#39;s asleep. Are you out of your</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.900" end="00:01:55.800" style="s2">mind?</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.600" end="00:01:57.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you weren&#39;t the one who slipped the</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.800" end="00:01:59.792" style="s2">drug, why won&#39;t you explain yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.900" end="00:02:02.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I told you, would you have her skip</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.792" end="00:02:02.792" style="s2">that birth control pill?</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.192" end="00:02:06.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me?</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.692" end="00:02:08.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just think I&#39;m passing the buck.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.292" end="00:02:09.792" style="s2">Besides, I&#39;m the one taking the fall.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.292" end="00:02:11.792" style="s2">What are you so mad about?</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.792" end="00:02:12.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is Zack really my child?</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.792" end="00:02:14.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See?</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.992" end="00:02:17.192" style="s2">You came to me not to clear up the</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.592" end="00:02:19.292" style="s2">misunderstanding from back then at all,</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.192" end="00:02:20.892" style="s2">nor to apologize to me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.292" end="00:02:21.892" style="s2">You only want to know if the baby is</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.892" end="00:02:24.292" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.892" end="00:02:25.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t change the subject. Answer me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.292" end="00:02:27.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t believe me, go abroad to</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.992" end="00:02:31.092" style="s2">get tested.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.892" end="00:02:31.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to go through all that trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.892" end="00:02:41.692" style="s2">A DNA test will tell us the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.992" end="00:02:44.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.692" end="00:02:50.492" style="s2">Baby,</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.992" end="00:02:53.292" style="s2">eat more so you can grow tall.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.492" end="00:02:53.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, grandma.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.492" end="00:02:55.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m full.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.892" end="00:03:02.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.092" end="00:03:04.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your brother&#39;s out of nowhere acting</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.692" end="00:03:05.092" style="s2">weird. He&#39;s never suspected anything</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.392" end="00:03:06.492" style="s2">before.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.092" end="00:03:08.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, easy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.492" end="00:03:09.692" style="s2">I&#39;ve got someone to help you. They can</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.192" end="00:03:10.992" style="s2">sort this out for sure and your brother</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.692" end="00:03:12.292" style="s2">won&#39;t find out a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.992" end="00:03:14.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.292" end="00:03:14.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This person.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.392" end="00:03:17.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got a death wish. Why&#39;d you bring</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.692" end="00:03:19.392" style="s2">him into this?</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.692" end="00:03:21.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t actually think I can fix this</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.392" end="00:03:21.992" style="s2">for you, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.292" end="00:03:25.792" style="s2">You know exactly what I&#39;m capable of.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.792" end="00:03:26.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.792" end="00:03:28.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.892" end="00:03:30.092" style="s2">Uh, I&#39;ve got something to take care of.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.692" end="00:03:30.692" style="s2">You two carry on.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.092" end="00:03:33.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.692" end="00:03:34.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe took off the second she saw me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.892" end="00:03:36.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.492" end="00:03:36.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.192" end="00:03:42.292" style="s2">Is it that serious? You look like you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.092" end="00:03:42.292" style="s2">struggling to get the words out.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.192" end="00:03:47.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just Toby overreacting. I can</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.992" end="00:03:49.792" style="s2">handle this on my own.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.192" end="00:03:51.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honestly, I just want to help you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.792" end="00:03:53.992" style="s2">Don&#39;t let it weigh on you at all.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.992" end="00:03:57.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I appreciate it, senior.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.992" end="00:03:57.692" style="s2">I&#39;d rather not trouble you with this.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.292" end="00:04:04.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I got a clear shot of the woman&#39;s face</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.892" end="00:04:07.494" style="s2">today. Remember that time you caught</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.194" end="00:04:07.494" style="s2">Vincent holding a woman at the hotel?</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.194" end="00:04:10.694" style="s2">How did the conversation go?</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.194" end="00:04:12.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ruined everything for me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.694" end="00:04:13.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The heir of the G family was seen having</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.394" end="00:04:15.494" style="s2">a secret rendezvous with a mystery</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.894" end="00:04:17.094" style="s2">woman, and their wedding is right around</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.494" end="00:04:18.594" style="s2">the corner.</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.094" end="00:04:21.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with her? Wait, isn&#39;t that</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.594" end="00:04:21.194" style="s2">the wife?</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.794" end="00:04:27.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve screwed me over.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.394" end="00:04:30.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.394" end="00:04:30.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a look for yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.394" end="00:04:36.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She looks such a mess.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.194" end="00:04:39.194" style="s2">No one would recognize her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.494" end="00:04:39.194" style="s2">Calm down.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.694" end="00:04:43.894" style="s2">Look, every time you run into trouble,</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.794" end="00:04:45.394" style="s2">he shows up right away. Maybe you should</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.894" end="00:04:47.094" style="s2">think about it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.394" end="00:04:49.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you like him so much, go for it</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.094" end="00:04:49.594" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.394" end="00:04:53.894" style="s2">If I&#39;d considered him, I would have</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.994" end="00:04:55.094" style="s2">chosen him back then.</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.894" end="00:04:56.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Has my brother been treating you too</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.094" end="00:04:57.794" style="s2">well lately, making you soft-hearted</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.694" end="00:05:00.094" style="s2">again?</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.794" end="00:05:01.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That rotten man flirts around and plays</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.094" end="00:05:03.494" style="s2">the field.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.494" end="00:05:05.394" style="s2">Just moments ago, he told Zoe he&#39;d treat</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.494" end="00:05:07.194" style="s2">her well for the rest of his life. Then</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.394" end="00:05:08.794" style="s2">he turns around and dangles a little</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.194" end="00:05:10.294" style="s2">treat in front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.794" end="00:05:12.994" style="s2">I think it&#39;s because he believes Zach is</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.294" end="00:05:12.994" style="s2">his child.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.594" end="00:05:19.294" style="s2">Where&#39;s Zach?</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.694" end="00:05:20.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zach went shopping with his grandma.</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.294" end="00:05:22.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.894" end="00:05:25.094" style="s2">Don&#39;t spill it before the DNA results</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.694" end="00:05:25.094" style="s2">come out.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.094" end="00:05:29.494" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.994" end="00:05:38.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you out of your mind? Why aren&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.194" end="00:05:41.994" style="s2">in his bed at night?</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.894" end="00:05:41.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See for yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.994" end="00:05:46.094" style="s2">You&#39;re not walking out that door until</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.494" end="00:05:47.994" style="s2">you explain this today.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.094" end="00:05:49.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These photos are fake.</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.994" end="00:05:51.494" style="s2">If you don&#39;t believe me, you can ask</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.094" end="00:05:51.494" style="s2">Toby.</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.294" end="00:05:56.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I&#39;d believe him?</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.794" end="00:05:58.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t believe him?</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.094" end="00:05:59.594" style="s2">So you don&#39;t believe me?</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.294" end="00:06:01.394" style="s2">If that&#39;s how it&#39;s going to be, let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.594" end="00:06:03.394" style="s2">get a divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.394" end="00:06:05.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In such a hurry to get divorced, go find</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.394" end="00:06:07.195" style="s2">Vincent.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.894" end="00:06:09.095" style="s2">Have you been lonely because I haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.195" end="00:06:10.895" style="s2">touched you since I got back?</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.095" end="00:06:12.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.895" end="00:06:14.995" style="s2">Yeah, I&#39;m lonely.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.695" end="00:06:17.595" style="s2">All right. Not only do I have Vincent</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.995" end="00:06:19.695" style="s2">out there, I&#39;ve also got 18 models on</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.595" end="00:06:22.095" style="s2">call.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.695" end="00:06:23.495" style="s2">So, you want to be the 20th?</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.095" end="00:06:26.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.495" end="00:06:28.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t even want to bother with you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.295" end="00:06:29.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you&#39;re dying to be Mrs. Justin,</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.095" end="00:06:32.095" style="s2">hand over all your shares in the Lou</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.495" end="00:06:33.395" style="s2">Corporation.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.095" end="00:06:36.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we get divorced, I won&#39;t take a</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.395" end="00:06:36.595" style="s2">single cent from the Lou group.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.395" end="00:06:42.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finn,</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.895" end="00:06:45.395" style="s2">bring all the contracts signed by Chloe</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.595" end="00:06:45.395" style="s2">to my office.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.995" end="00:06:51.195" style="s2">Did Chloe negotiate this land parcel?</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.295" end="00:06:52.795" style="s2">This contract belongs to Chloe from last</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.195" end="00:06:54.595" style="s2">week.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.795" end="00:06:55.995" style="s2">This contract was signed by Chloe the</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.595" end="00:06:58.095" style="s2">week prior.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.995" end="00:07:00.495" style="s2">What exactly are you aiming for? Make</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.095" end="00:07:02.295" style="s2">her hand over all her shares. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.495" end="00:07:06.395" style="s2">flinch in the meeting later.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.295" end="00:07:06.395" style="s2">Take down that parachute in pretty face.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.495" end="00:07:11.295" style="s2">If she keeps going like this, we can</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.695" end="00:07:12.295" style="s2">forget about dividends by the end of the</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.295" end="00:07:14.095" style="s2">year.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.295" end="00:07:15.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all because senior directors back</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.095" end="00:07:17.544" style="s2">her. They handed her the shares and fled</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.895" end="00:07:17.895" style="s2">overseas.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.544" end="00:07:19.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.895" end="00:07:22.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, that vixen really isn&#39;t easy to</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.795" end="00:07:22.395" style="s2">deal with.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.895" end="00:07:30.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What rubbish are you all talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.295" end="00:07:32.495" style="s2">As stipulated by law, anyone who</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.495" end="00:07:34.595" style="s2">fabricates facts to defame others may be</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.495" end="00:07:36.395" style="s2">suspected of the crime of defamation.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.595" end="00:07:38.195" style="s2">You could face imprisonment, criminal</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.395" end="00:07:40.595" style="s2">detention, or public</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.195" end="00:07:43.095" style="s2">Wait home for the court summons.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.595" end="00:07:43.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young lady.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.595" end="00:07:50.695" style="s2">Everyone here?</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.095" end="00:07:53.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All here.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.695" end="00:07:53.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s get started.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.895" end="00:07:57.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just need to know who purchased this</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.395" end="00:07:58.795" style="s2">land. Have her take personal</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.195" end="00:07:59.295" style="s2">responsibility and put up her shares as</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.795" end="00:08:00.995" style="s2">collateral.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.295" end="00:08:02.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. 300 billion spent on a</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.995" end="00:08:03.895" style="s2">worthless plot out west. How many years</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.695" end="00:08:05.095" style="s2">will it take to develop the western</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.895" end="00:08:06.495" style="s2">district? How many of us are going to</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.095" end="00:08:06.895" style="s2">take a hit on our dividends because of</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.495" end="00:08:08.097" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.895" end="00:08:09.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Chloe, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.097" end="00:08:11.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; just a woman. You ought to go find</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.597" end="00:08:13.197" style="s2">yourself a husband, get married and tend</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.397" end="00:08:14.497" style="s2">to your family. You didn&#39;t build this</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.197" end="00:08:15.597" style="s2">company from the ground up. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.497" end="00:08:17.097" style="s2">understand a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.597" end="00:08:18.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Spending 300 billion on a tract of land</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.097" end="00:08:20.597" style="s2">isn&#39;t the same as dropping 300,000 on a</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.897" end="00:08:23.697" style="s2">handbag or 3 million on a dress. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.597" end="00:08:23.697" style="s2">nowhere near that simple.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.797" end="00:08:31.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Chloe, if you cannot bear this risk</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.297" end="00:08:31.697" style="s2">and take responsibility,</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.797" end="00:08:38.297" style="s2">you can pledge your shares to me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.197" end="00:08:40.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Justin, you&#39;ve got quite a scheme worked</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.297" end="00:08:44.697" style="s2">out, but</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.697" end="00:08:48.697" style="s2">just moments ago, those 300 billion</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.697" end="00:08:48.697" style="s2">it surged more than 10 fold.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.141" end="00:08:57.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.197" end="00:09:00.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I seen you may even to sleep either.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.197" end="00:09:07.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5 years ago, the announcement of the</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.397" end="00:09:07.297" style="s2">development of the high-tech zone.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.797" end="00:09:13.897" style="s2">If you are interested in the</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.597" end="00:09:16.097" style="s2">model, you can have a look.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.897" end="00:09:18.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re living in a fantasy world. With</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.097" end="00:09:22.097" style="s2">all the big players out there,</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.497" end="00:09:24.297" style="s2">what makes you so damn sure?</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.097" end="00:09:26.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We just landed the West District bid.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.297" end="00:09:28.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unexpectedly, it is the least</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.297" end="00:09:30.397" style="s2">optimistic. The West District won the</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.597" end="00:09:34.097" style="s2">bid. Isn&#39;t that the whole the</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.397" end="00:09:34.097" style="s2">construction of the high-tech zone?</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.197" end="00:09:40.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t it speculated that it will not be</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.697" end="00:09:41.097" style="s2">announced until next month?</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.097" end="00:09:42.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.097" end="00:09:43.997" style="s2">Our model is not as precise as you just</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.997" end="00:09:46.597" style="s2">sent us.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.997" end="00:09:50.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if there is 300 billion now, we</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.597" end="00:09:50.597" style="s2">can&#39;t take the West in the right</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.897" end="00:09:56.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just girl so young that</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.497" end="00:10:03.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have plan.</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.297" end="00:10:05.897" style="s2">I see one you can to your work. However,</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.797" end="00:10:07.297" style="s2">I recently found that the company&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.897" end="00:10:09.097" style="s2">financial</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.297" end="00:10:09.997" style="s2">there is a big problem.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.097" end="00:10:11.998" style="s2">The</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.997" end="00:10:13.898" style="s2">know are the finance.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.998" end="00:10:17.098" style="s2">I believe that finance can&#39;t do such a</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.898" end="00:10:18.898" style="s2">thing without the boss&#39;s instructions.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.098" end="00:10:22.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go to the toilet.</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.898" end="00:10:25.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Chong, the chairman of Haimo Branch,</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.798" end="00:10:25.698" style="s2">is it your son?</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.898" end="00:10:29.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t raise my boy right.</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.798" end="00:10:31.098" style="s2">That&#39;s on me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.498" end="00:10:32.798" style="s2">I will make up for Haimo&#39;s accounts</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.098" end="00:10:34.298" style="s2">privately.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.798" end="00:10:36.598" style="s2">Can you let me go?</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.298" end="00:10:39.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What I said as a woman doesn&#39;t count?</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.598" end="00:10:39.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, please.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.998" end="00:10:46.198" style="s2">Even if you somehow land that west side</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.698" end="00:10:46.198" style="s2">plot,</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.898" end="00:10:56.498" style="s2">you can&#39;t be sure either. Send out the</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.798" end="00:10:56.498" style="s2">memo today.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.698" end="00:11:01.298" style="s2">Where did the news come from? Did</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.398" end="00:11:01.298" style="s2">Vincent give it to you?</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.498" end="00:11:04.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vincent,</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.298" end="00:11:06.898" style="s2">all anyone cares about right now is the</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.798" end="00:11:08.398" style="s2">bottom line.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.898" end="00:11:12.298" style="s2">You are the only one who has a long</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.398" end="00:11:12.298" style="s2">relationship here. Are you not sick?</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.498" end="00:11:17.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you make a deal with him?</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.698" end="00:11:23.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What my real endgame is, haven&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.898" end="00:11:25.198" style="s2">figured it out by now?</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.898" end="00:11:27.298" style="s2">Divorce,</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.198" end="00:11:30.198" style="s2">usurpment,</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.298" end="00:11:31.898" style="s2">property of the Lu family.</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.198" end="00:11:33.298" style="s2">What exactly do you think I leveraged to</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.898" end="00:11:34.998" style="s2">get it?</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.298" end="00:11:37.898" style="s2">Did you make a deal with him?</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.998" end="00:11:39.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, you weren&#39;t like this before.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.898" end="00:11:42.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who I was back then,</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.698" end="00:11:42.998" style="s2">I honestly can&#39;t remember.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.098" end="00:11:47.698" style="s2">Haven&#39;t you always been very clear about</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.498" end="00:11:47.698" style="s2">my ruthless ambition?</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.798" end="00:11:58.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.998" end="00:12:00.698" style="s2">stay and talk about it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.298" end="00:12:02.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir Kun, I&#39;m off work today. What is it</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.698" end="00:12:05.798" style="s2">now? Let&#39;s talk in the company tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.998" end="00:12:05.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you want me to leave?</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.898" end="00:12:10.498" style="s2">My old man tells me you&#39;re pretty good</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.398" end="00:12:12.098" style="s2">at settling accounts. So,</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.498" end="00:12:13.799" style="s2">why don&#39;t you give me a little lesson</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.098" end="00:12:16.499" style="s2">how to settle accounts with the person</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.799" end="00:12:16.499" style="s2">who cheated me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.699" end="00:12:24.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir Quinn, what the hell are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.799" end="00:12:26.199" style="s2">I&#39;m warning you. I&#39;m the second largest</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.499" end="00:12:27.599" style="s2">shareholder of the Seven A Group and you</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.199" end="00:12:29.499" style="s2">do not not want to mess with me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.599" end="00:12:31.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Woah, take it easy. I&#39;m just here to</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.499" end="00:12:33.799" style="s2">have a little chat with you. You flex</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.599" end="00:12:36.199" style="s2">your muscles and I&#39;m the one taking the</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.799" end="00:12:36.699" style="s2">hit. Now I&#39;m officially unemployed and</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.199" end="00:12:38.699" style="s2">you&#39;re going to have to take</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.699" end="00:12:40.299" style="s2">responsibility for me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.699" end="00:12:42.099" style="s2">Look, before I go out and get a real</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.299" end="00:12:43.599" style="s2">job, I figured I&#39;d learn a thing or two</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.099" end="00:12:44.999" style="s2">from you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.599" end="00:12:46.999" style="s2">I&#39;m looking at this Han Mao account and</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.999" end="00:12:48.599" style="s2">it&#39;s completely spotless. There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.999" end="00:12:49.999" style="s2">nothing wrong with it. If you think</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.599" end="00:12:50.899" style="s2">there is something wrong, come on, just</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.999" end="00:12:52.999" style="s2">teach me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.899" end="00:12:55.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About the Han Mao situation, are we</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.999" end="00:12:57.799" style="s2">really not involving the cops?</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.299" end="00:12:59.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve known about that for two years.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.799" end="00:13:02.699" style="s2">I&#39;m keeping Jiang around on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.399" end="00:13:02.699" style="s2">He&#39;s still useful to me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.699" end="00:13:07.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Justin,</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.999" end="00:13:11.299" style="s2">you and Chloe didn&#39;t come home and you</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.399" end="00:13:11.299" style="s2">couldn&#39;t even give me a heads up.</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.799" end="00:13:17.199" style="s2">Chloe isn&#39;t answering her phone either.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.999" end="00:13:19.399" style="s2">Forget about working overtime. You stay</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.199" end="00:13:20.799" style="s2">the hell away from my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.399" end="00:13:23.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.799" end="00:13:23.699" style="s2">I&#39;ll call you back later.</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.699" end="00:13:29.999" style="s2">Isn&#39;t Chloe off work yet?</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.899" end="00:13:32.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe left early.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.999" end="00:13:34.499" style="s2">Go check with Toby. Wait a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.599" end="00:13:37.099" style="s2">If it&#39;s not with Toby,</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.499" end="00:13:38.799" style="s2">look into Vincent&#39;s whereabouts. Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.099" end="00:13:40.299" style="s2">Vincent took a last minute trip to Jiang</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.799" end="00:13:41.999" style="s2">Shang tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.299" end="00:13:44.699" style="s2">Take a girl there.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.999" end="00:13:45.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard that it is not an employee,</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.699" end="00:13:47.299" style="s2">but we are not sure of the girl&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.799" end="00:13:49.299" style="s2">identity yet.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.299" end="00:13:51.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I handed to Chloe. It&#39;s only one</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.299" end="00:13:53.099" style="s2">night. Cleared up those books just like</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.499" end="00:13:56.499" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.099" end="00:13:56.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go back to the company first.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.199" end="00:14:00.399" style="s2">Otherwise, there&#39;s no way I can pull</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.799" end="00:14:01.699" style="s2">this off for you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.399" end="00:14:03.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need to get me back into the</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.699" end="00:14:06.199" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.099" end="00:14:06.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Otherwise, how would I know?</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.599" end="00:14:10.499" style="s2">What else can I do?</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.599" end="00:14:14.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, Vincent just returned to the</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.299" end="00:14:14.599" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.399" end="00:14:18.201" style="s2">Where is Chloe?</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.401" end="00:14:21.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haven&#39;t come back yet.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.301" end="00:14:25.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.001" end="00:14:30.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you go last night?</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.001" end="00:14:33.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you control it?</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.501" end="00:14:33.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you so shameless?</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.101" end="00:14:38.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For a night spring miss.</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.201" end="00:14:41.101" style="s2">You took off to Jiang Cho with him</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.501" end="00:14:41.101" style="s2">overnight.</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.301" end="00:14:46.001" style="s2">Couldn&#39;t even waste a single second,</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.101" end="00:14:48.301" style="s2">could you? What are you pretending to</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.001" end="00:14:50.301" style="s2">be? You can&#39;t see anyone all night.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.301" end="00:14:51.401" style="s2">Isn&#39;t it just sleeping with Vincent?</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.301" end="00:14:53.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.401" end="00:14:55.201" style="s2">Since you miss me so much, then we just</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.401" end="00:14:57.301" style="s2">got divorced.</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.201" end="00:14:58.201" style="s2">Otherwise, I will have count Vincent</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.301" end="00:14:59.601" style="s2">outside.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.201" end="00:15:01.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, I&#39;ll see what other tricks you</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.601" end="00:15:01.901" style="s2">have.</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.401" end="00:15:10.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe!</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.901" end="00:15:18.201" style="s2">Oh my god, Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.501" end="00:15:21.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe is in a coma caused by</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.201" end="00:15:22.601" style="s2">malnutrition and excessive fatigue.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.501" end="00:15:25.601" style="s2">Let&#39;s stay in the hospital for</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.601" end="00:15:27.301" style="s2">observation first.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.601" end="00:15:28.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So when will he wake up?</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.301" end="00:15:30.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her sleep more.</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.801" end="00:15:33.101" style="s2">She needs a rest.</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.501" end="00:15:33.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.001" end="00:15:42.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.801" end="00:15:47.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here to find Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.401" end="00:15:50.101" style="s2">I heard that she is sick. Come and have</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.701" end="00:15:50.101" style="s2">a look.</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.701" end="00:15:55.101" style="s2">Weren&#39;t we still together last night?</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.401" end="00:15:56.201" style="s2">It&#39;s so hard to give up.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.101" end="00:15:57.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe and I have known each other for a</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.201" end="00:15:59.101" style="s2">long time.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.801" end="00:16:01.801" style="s2">It&#39;s normal for her to come to see her</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.101" end="00:16:01.801" style="s2">when she is sick.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.301" end="00:16:07.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not a short time for you to accept</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.201" end="00:16:11.901" style="s2">the project. There are so many projects</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.801" end="00:16:13.301" style="s2">stuck in your hand without any progress.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.901" end="00:16:15.101" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you afraid that the project will</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.301" end="00:16:17.301" style="s2">be yellow?</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.101" end="00:16:18.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on with my company?</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.301" end="00:16:22.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay away from Chloe</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.902" end="00:16:22.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; or you can&#39;t afford the consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.402" end="00:16:28.202" style="s2">Justin, you are afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.302" end="00:16:32.802" style="s2">You know that Chloe will not choose you</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.202" end="00:16:32.802" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.602" end="00:16:39.502" style="s2">As for the consequences, you can try.</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.502" end="00:16:42.402" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to worry about the</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.502" end="00:16:42.402" style="s2">affairs between us.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.202" end="00:16:48.702" style="s2">You better worry more about yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.402" end="00:16:56.102" style="s2">Chloe, you don&#39;t want property.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.202" end="00:16:59.002" style="s2">You want my life.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.502" end="00:17:08.902" style="s2">Tired.</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.702" end="00:17:10.602" style="s2">The doctor said that you are too tired.</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.902" end="00:17:12.102" style="s2">It seems that Vincent treats you like</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.602" end="00:17:14.702" style="s2">that he doesn&#39;t even bother to take care</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.102" end="00:17:14.702" style="s2">of his health.</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.102" end="00:17:21.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After all, she is someone else&#39;s wife.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.202" end="00:17:22.902" style="s2">Why are you so pitiful?</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.102" end="00:17:25.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.902" end="00:17:28.302" style="s2">Mom and uncle refuse to talk properly,</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.002" end="00:17:28.302" style="s2">and I don&#39;t want to talk anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.702" end="00:17:34.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, baby is a little worried about</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.902" end="00:17:35.502" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.102" end="00:17:37.182" style="s2">Take him over to see you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.502" end="00:17:39.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.182" end="00:17:40.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.102" end="00:17:42.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baby,</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.502" end="00:17:44.002" style="s2">you are worried about mom.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.302" end="00:17:45.402" style="s2">Mom is fine.</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.002" end="00:17:48.202" style="s2">It will be fine soon.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.402" end="00:17:50.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, it&#39;s time to eat. According to</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.202" end="00:17:53.402" style="s2">the order of the Justin, it is large and</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.702" end="00:17:53.402" style="s2">nutritious.</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.502" end="00:18:02.502" style="s2">Don&#39;t add coriander.</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.102" end="00:18:05.502" style="s2">Eat it quickly.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.502" end="00:18:08.902" style="s2">Baby, let&#39;s let mom have a good rest.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.502" end="00:18:08.902" style="s2">Let&#39;s let mom have a good rest.</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.302" end="00:18:14.502" style="s2">Come back tomorrow, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.702" end="00:18:19.902" style="s2">Let&#39;s go back today.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.502" end="00:18:22.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The doctor said you are malnourished.</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.902" end="00:18:24.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do Do want me to die or let me live?</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.103" end="00:18:26.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should ask you this question.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.103" end="00:18:27.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it funny to slap a sweet date?</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.103" end="00:18:29.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m willing to. If you don&#39;t take good</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.903" end="00:18:31.303" style="s2">care of your health, how can you fight</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.103" end="00:18:33.003" style="s2">with me?</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.303" end="00:18:35.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Justin, even the baby knows how to talk</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.003" end="00:18:37.103" style="s2">well. Can you?</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.103" end="00:18:38.503" style="s2">I want to move out of the old house. The</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.103" end="00:18:40.303" style="s2">last time I moved back was cuz my</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.503" end="00:18:42.003" style="s2">grandfather was sick. Now my grandfather</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.303" end="00:18:43.803" style="s2">is well.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.003" end="00:18:45.303" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to lie to him.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.803" end="00:18:46.603" style="s2">I can&#39;t give him the great grandpa son</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.303" end="00:18:47.403" style="s2">he wants.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.603" end="00:18:49.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.403" end="00:18:50.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10,000 steps back. You don&#39;t want me to</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.903" end="00:18:54.003" style="s2">give birth.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.803" end="00:18:54.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know I don&#39;t want to?</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.403" end="00:18:59.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you afraid</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.103" end="00:19:00.803" style="s2">will I use my children to steal property</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.303" end="00:19:02.903" style="s2">from you?</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.803" end="00:19:05.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.903" end="00:19:05.903" style="s2">Will you give birth to me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.203" end="00:19:07.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.903" end="00:19:10.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you just say you were willing to</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.403" end="00:19:14.003" style="s2">have a baby with me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.003" end="00:19:16.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I mean I&#39;m willing to give grandpa a</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.003" end="00:19:16.703" style="s2">grandson.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.703" end="00:19:25.203" style="s2">I mean you didn&#39;t want me to give birth.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.503" end="00:19:25.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m willing to.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.603" end="00:19:30.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I sick or are you sick?</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.203" end="00:19:35.203" style="s2">I don&#39;t have a fever.</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.703" end="00:19:44.503" style="s2">I&#39;ll do it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.403" end="00:19:50.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are quite changeable.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.703" end="00:19:51.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Birds of a feather flock together.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.303" end="00:19:54.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The personality is too similar.</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.903" end="00:19:54.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You too.</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.003" end="00:19:58.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With too similar personalities are not</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.003" end="00:20:00.603" style="s2">suitable for friends, lethal a longer</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.903" end="00:20:01.703" style="s2">husband one feet.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.603" end="00:20:04.703" style="s2">I&#39;ll do it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.703" end="00:20:04.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why so much nonsense?</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.103" end="00:20:16.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you scared?</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.703" end="00:20:16.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I &#39;m not afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.703" end="00:20:24.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are not afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.703" end="00:20:25.905" style="s2">Then go to bed quickly.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.503" end="00:20:28.305" style="s2">The doctor said you should take more</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.905" end="00:20:28.305" style="s2">rest.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.105" end="00:20:32.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shh.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.205" end="00:20:35.105" style="s2">It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.805" end="00:20:35.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.005" end="00:20:49.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.405" end="00:20:49.105" style="s2">I&#39;m starting again.</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.505" end="00:20:52.705" style="s2">Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.005" end="00:20:56.605" style="s2">Start again.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.705" end="00:20:56.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I sick or is he sick?</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.705" end="00:21:03.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.705" end="00:21:06.605" style="s2">someone just sent the information. He</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.305" end="00:21:06.605" style="s2">said he must hand it over to you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.705" end="00:21:19.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is the person who sent it?</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.805" end="00:21:22.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Already left. He is a young man.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.605" end="00:21:22.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.779" end="00:21:28.905" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.905" end="00:21:30.005" style="s2">Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.905" end="00:21:31.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t want to be on the hot</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.005" end="00:21:33.105" style="s2">search,</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.505" end="00:21:36.205" style="s2">and million ready.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.105" end="00:21:36.205" style="s2">See you in the afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.905" end="00:21:43.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which newspaper are you from?</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.905" end="00:21:45.005" style="s2">These photos, where did you come from?</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.205" end="00:21:47.105" style="s2">Money,</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.005" end="00:21:48.405" style="s2">I can give it to you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.105" end="00:21:49.705" style="s2">But I have to know the source of these</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.405" end="00:21:50.905" style="s2">photos.</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.705" end="00:21:52.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can do it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.905" end="00:21:54.605" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid you don&#39;t know much about it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.805" end="00:21:57.105" style="s2">The customer gives money to eliminate</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.605" end="00:21:59.205" style="s2">the evidence. If you want no more, it</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.105" end="00:22:01.005" style="s2">depends your own ability.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.205" end="00:22:02.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay not to say anything.</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.005" end="00:22:06.605" style="s2">You can send it to show Piers directly</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.405" end="00:22:06.605" style="s2">to the any want, but I can guarantee.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.005" end="00:22:11.605" style="s2">These photos are all dead when you see</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.405" end="00:22:13.405" style="s2">the light.</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.605" end="00:22:16.505" style="s2">At that time,</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.405" end="00:22:17.705" style="s2">you can&#39;t get a penny.</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.505" end="00:22:20.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seems that you don&#39;t care about your</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.705" end="00:22:23.605" style="s2">reputation at all.</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.005" end="00:22:23.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much is the reputation worth?</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.305" end="00:22:29.306" style="s2">Well, let&#39;s discuss it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.506" end="00:22:31.606" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you 500,000 yen. You hand over</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.306" end="00:22:35.406" style="s2">the person behind the scenes.</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.606" end="00:22:38.206" style="s2">Otherwise, see you in court.</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.406" end="00:22:40.806" style="s2">This is the end of the game.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.206" end="00:22:40.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not quite.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.706" end="00:22:57.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shaken, it was you all along.</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.106" end="00:22:59.306" style="s2">You planned this during the last</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.206" end="00:23:00.906" style="s2">kidnapping.</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.306" end="00:23:02.906" style="s2">You not only want to extort my money,</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.906" end="00:23:03.806" style="s2">but also want to destroy my reputation.</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.906" end="00:23:04.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seems that you are not completely a</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.806" end="00:23:06.006" style="s2">bass. You said you didn&#39;t reply to the</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.906" end="00:23:07.306" style="s2">position for me. You hid from me for</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.006" end="00:23:09.606" style="s2">several days. What do you think I can</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.306" end="00:23:09.606" style="s2">do?</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.106" end="00:23:14.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think that</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.306" end="00:23:15.906" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you afraid of that photo at all?</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.306" end="00:23:18.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what should I do? Then what should</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.906" end="00:23:18.606" style="s2">I do?</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.906" end="00:23:24.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.606" end="00:23:26.306" style="s2">Why don&#39;t we pretend to be real?</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.906" end="00:23:27.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.306" end="00:23:29.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is Chloe?</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.506" end="00:23:31.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know. Someone asked me to give</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.406" end="00:23:33.306" style="s2">her the document today.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.606" end="00:23:36.106" style="s2">She didn&#39;t look good after reading it</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.306" end="00:23:36.106" style="s2">and then went out.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.406" end="00:23:38.806" style="s2">Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.106" end="00:23:41.906" style="s2">I have a bad feeling.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.306" end="00:23:46.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.606" end="00:23:52.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Use all your strength.</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.306" end="00:23:52.306" style="s2">Go to find it right away.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.806" end="00:23:58.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop it. Stop it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.506" end="00:24:02.306" style="s2">Stop it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.606" end="00:24:02.306" style="s2">Don&#39;t you want money? I&#39;LL GIVE YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.906" end="00:24:11.906" style="s2">As long as you let me go,</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.206" end="00:24:14.506" style="s2">I will transfer 10 million to you</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.906" end="00:24:14.506" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.206" end="00:24:19.406" style="s2">Immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.506" end="00:24:22.206" style="s2">Let me free, please.</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.406" end="00:24:25.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have 20% of the shares in Sevla</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.206" end="00:24:25.906" style="s2">Group. How much is that?</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.006" end="00:24:30.707" style="s2">I can be fascinated by this money.</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.408" end="00:24:33.007" style="s2">Besides,</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.707" end="00:24:36.107" style="s2">you are so beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.007" end="00:24:38.607" style="s2">It&#39;s hard for me not to be fascinat</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.107" end="00:24:41.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t do anything stupid. I&#39;m married.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.607" end="00:24:43.908" style="s2">My husband</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.007" end="00:24:45.807" style="s2">My husband is Justin.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.908" end="00:24:47.522" style="s2">If you don&#39;t believe it, you can check</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.807" end="00:24:49.542" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.522" end="00:24:49.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.607" end="00:24:55.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who doesn&#39;t know that Justin and Zoe are</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.807" end="00:24:57.908" style="s2">a couple? You said you were lying. You</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.507" end="00:25:00.408" style="s2">should use your brain.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.908" end="00:25:00.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me. LET GO OF ME.</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.207" end="00:25:06.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T BE AFRAID. IT&#39;S OKAY.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.792" end="00:25:14.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.507" end="00:25:17.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what if WE SLEPT TOGETHER? SHUT UP.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.007" end="00:25:17.408" style="s2">Stand on. Come with us.</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.307" end="00:25:24.707" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.607" end="00:25:29.207" style="s2">Come on with me first. I&#39;ll see a</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.607" end="00:25:32.908" style="s2">doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.207" end="00:25:32.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, thank you. I can go home by myself.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.908" end="00:25:44.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, Vincent came one step earlier than</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.908" end="00:25:44.807" style="s2">us and picked up the lady.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.307" end="00:25:48.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.807" end="00:25:54.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe,</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.207" end="00:25:54.908" style="s2">let&#39;s start again.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.607" end="00:26:05.107" style="s2">Go home.</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.707" end="00:26:11.707" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.007" end="00:26:11.707" style="s2">We need to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.307" end="00:26:18.007" style="s2">I&#39;m going to get the medicine box.</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.607" end="00:26:19.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Justin,</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.007" end="00:26:22.507" style="s2">let&#39;s get a divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.707" end="00:26:26.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, you should know grandpa once set</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.507" end="00:26:26.607" style="s2">a family rule to never leave bigamy.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.107" end="00:26:31.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s get a divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.408" end="00:26:33.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Divorce will</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.209" end="00:26:33.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; be possible.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.409" end="00:26:37.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, are you crazy? Put down the knife</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.409" end="00:26:39.109" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.109" end="00:26:41.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t come here.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.109" end="00:26:44.509" style="s2">[ __ ] your family rules. I can&#39;t live</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.209" end="00:26:45.709" style="s2">this kind of day for a day.</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.509" end="00:26:47.009" style="s2">Divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.709" end="00:26:47.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be impulsive and put down the</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.009" end="00:26:49.409" style="s2">knife first.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.509" end="00:26:52.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told YOU NOT TO COME HERE.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.409" end="00:26:54.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be impulsive.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.309" end="00:26:57.309" style="s2">Think about the baby.</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.809" end="00:26:58.909" style="s2">The baby also said that we are adults.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.309" end="00:27:00.909" style="s2">If you want to say, say it well.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.909" end="00:27:02.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do something to say.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.909" end="00:27:04.409" style="s2">Where were you when I was kidnapped by</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.409" end="00:27:06.409" style="s2">him and almost bullied by him?</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.409" end="00:27:10.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a meeting in the company.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.409" end="00:27:10.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the meeting you lied to me again.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.309" end="00:27:18.609" style="s2">Which female star are you having a</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.409" end="00:27:18.609" style="s2">meeting with in the hotel?</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.509" end="00:27:26.909" style="s2">Why do you bully me SO MUCH?</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.109" end="00:27:28.709" style="s2">WHY ARE YOU DRAGGING me to refuse to</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.909" end="00:27:30.809" style="s2">divorce?</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.709" end="00:27:32.609" style="s2">Do you have to FORCE ME TO DIE? WHY</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.809" end="00:27:33.209" style="s2">DON&#39;T YOU divorce me?</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.609" end="00:27:35.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.209" end="00:27:37.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I used to like you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.809" end="00:27:39.109" style="s2">But my life is so long that I can&#39;t like</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.509" end="00:27:40.809" style="s2">you as before.</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.109" end="00:27:42.809" style="s2">I love you without dignity and what</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.809" end="00:27:44.309" style="s2">reservation.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.809" end="00:27:46.609" style="s2">What on earth do you want me to do</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.309" end="00:27:48.809" style="s2">before you let me go? What on earth do</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.609" end="00:27:52.309" style="s2">you want me to do?</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.809" end="00:27:52.309" style="s2">You are willing to let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.409" end="00:28:05.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, I didn&#39;t arrive in time today.</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.809" end="00:28:08.109" style="s2">It&#39;s my fault. It&#39;s my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.709" end="00:28:08.109" style="s2">Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.909" end="00:28:19.309" style="s2">I&#39;m not with anyone else today.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.609" end="00:28:24.009" style="s2">You are the only one in my heart from</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.509" end="00:28:25.609" style="s2">beginning to end.</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.009" end="00:28:27.909" style="s2">So don&#39;t think about what you have,</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.609" end="00:28:27.909" style="s2">okay?</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.609" end="00:28:33.609" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you tell me when you were</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.809" end="00:28:33.609" style="s2">kidnapped by him?</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.109" end="00:28:38.310" style="s2">If you don&#39;t say many things, I will</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.510" end="00:28:38.310" style="s2">misunderstand.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.410" end="00:28:42.710" style="s2">I told you well, but you ignored me</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.910" end="00:28:42.710" style="s2">again, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.510" end="00:28:47.810" style="s2">I&#39;m not as good as your son.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.210" end="00:28:50.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you give me a chance? Will you</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.810" end="00:28:51.610" style="s2">believe what I said?</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.410" end="00:28:54.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe,</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.610" end="00:28:56.710" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. It was all my fault before. I</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.310" end="00:28:58.510" style="s2">was too impulsive.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.710" end="00:29:01.410" style="s2">I will change it in the youth here, no</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.510" end="00:29:03.310" style="s2">matter what happens in the future.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.410" end="00:29:05.410" style="s2">I will trust you unconditionally. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.310" end="00:29:06.910" style="s2">stop quarreling every day. Be together</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.410" end="00:29:09.210" style="s2">well in the future.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.910" end="00:29:09.210" style="s2">Okay?</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.510" end="00:29:24.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shaking got bailed out.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.210" end="00:29:29.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somebody help!</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.010" end="00:29:31.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shaking, you&#39;ve got some serious nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.410" end="00:29:34.410" style="s2">If I don&#39;t break you today, then my last</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.510" end="00:29:34.410" style="s2">name isn&#39;t Toby.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.010" end="00:29:38.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.930" end="00:29:46.010" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.810" end="00:29:47.510" style="s2">Mr. Justin, what are you doing here? I</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.010" end="00:29:50.710" style="s2">really didn&#39;t know she was your wife. I</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.510" end="00:29:50.710" style="s2">I&#39;d never dare to do that.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.910" end="00:29:54.610" style="s2">Mr. C, no, no, please.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.010" end="00:30:04.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get him to Furton.</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.910" end="00:30:07.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me a ride back, will you? Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.910" end="00:30:09.410" style="s2">Let me see Chloe too, please.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.410" end="00:30:10.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure love gossiping about me to</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.410" end="00:30:12.410" style="s2">Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.810" end="00:30:14.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro, your wife and I are just friends.</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.410" end="00:30:15.710" style="s2">Bro, wait.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.110" end="00:30:17.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s had a crush on you since school.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.710" end="00:30:17.910" style="s2">Wherever you go, she follows you</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.110" end="00:30:19.910" style="s2">everywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.910" end="00:30:21.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She smiled at you. You saw that</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.910" end="00:30:24.610" style="s2">yourself. Why would I lie? I don&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.610" end="00:30:24.610" style="s2">any feelings for her.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.610" end="00:30:30.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.910" end="00:30:30.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Roger that.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.810" end="00:30:37.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened to your face, Mr. Justin?</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.510" end="00:30:38.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got scratched</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.112" end="00:30:40.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; by the cat.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.112" end="00:30:43.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of cat is that, fierce?</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.712" end="00:30:44.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She cat.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.312" end="00:30:45.412" style="s2">I haven&#39;t thank you yet for everything</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.412" end="00:30:48.712" style="s2">with Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.412" end="00:30:48.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe is my friend, too.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.712" end="00:30:55.712" style="s2">How could I ever put her in harm&#39;s way?</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.412" end="00:30:55.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Either way, I really appreciate it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.912" end="00:31:00.312" style="s2">If there&#39;s something you&#39;d like, just</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.012" end="00:31:01.912" style="s2">tell me. I&#39;ll take care of it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.312" end="00:31:03.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.912" end="00:31:06.912" style="s2">at all?</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.512" end="00:31:08.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything is fine. Just as a thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.912" end="00:31:10.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How about you come with me to pick out a</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.312" end="00:31:12.712" style="s2">gift? My dad&#39;s birthday is coming up in</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.112" end="00:31:12.712" style="s2">a few days.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.712" end="00:31:16.012" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.112" end="00:31:26.412" style="s2">Justin, this tie looks great on you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.712" end="00:31:28.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zoe, just pick out the gift for your</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.412" end="00:31:28.812" style="s2">father.</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.412" end="00:31:34.912" style="s2">I&#39;m going to pursue Chloe again.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.712" end="00:31:36.612" style="s2">Unless it&#39;s absolutely necessary, let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.912" end="00:31:39.212" style="s2">not see each other anymore. If you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.612" end="00:31:42.312" style="s2">facing any difficulties in life,</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.212" end="00:31:42.312" style="s2">feel free to reach out to Finn.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.712" end="00:31:48.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have a lot of events to attend.</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.312" end="00:31:49.412" style="s2">You should keep a few extra ties around.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.212" end="00:31:51.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what you&#39;re saying, but it&#39;s only</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.412" end="00:31:54.012" style="s2">Chloe for me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.112" end="00:31:56.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been waiting for you for so long.</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.012" end="00:31:57.212" style="s2">Don&#39;t I have even a little place in your</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.112" end="00:31:58.612" style="s2">heart?</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.212" end="00:32:00.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will make sure you are taken care of</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.612" end="00:32:02.712" style="s2">for the rest of your life.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.912" end="00:32:06.012" style="s2">As for the rest,</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.712" end="00:32:06.012" style="s2">it never even crossed my mind.</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.112" end="00:32:10.312" style="s2">For that young lady&#39;s bill, please use</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.112" end="00:32:12.712" style="s2">this card. There&#39;s no PIN.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.312" end="00:32:12.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.412" end="00:32:18.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do Justin and Chloe actually have</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.012" end="00:32:20.212" style="s2">something going on? The way Justin</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.912" end="00:32:21.312" style="s2">looked at Chloe this morning, that was</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.212" end="00:32:23.712" style="s2">intense.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.312" end="00:32:26.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, you have no idea. Zoe was just</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.712" end="00:32:28.612" style="s2">downstairs helping Justin with his tie.</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.012" end="00:32:30.312" style="s2">It was seriously way too sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.612" end="00:32:32.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on here during working</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.312" end="00:32:32.712" style="s2">hours?</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.712" end="00:32:36.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.912" end="00:32:38.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.612" end="00:32:40.213" style="s2">Madam heard from the staff that you went</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.513" end="00:32:41.713" style="s2">shopping with Zoe and just left straight</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.213" end="00:32:43.313" style="s2">after work.</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.713" end="00:32:44.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cancel the year-end bonus for anyone who</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.313" end="00:32:46.713" style="s2">can&#39;t keep their mouth shut.</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.513" end="00:32:47.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.713" end="00:32:49.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.613" end="00:32:53.013" style="s2">are we leaving?</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.913" end="00:32:53.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetie, come here.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.213" end="00:32:57.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t want to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.513" end="00:33:00.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.513" end="00:33:02.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like grandma.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.113" end="00:33:04.713" style="s2">She&#39;s with me every day.</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.613" end="00:33:06.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy&#39;s sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.713" end="00:33:08.113" style="s2">I haven&#39;t spent enough time with you,</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.113" end="00:33:11.013" style="s2">sweetie.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.113" end="00:33:13.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you should apologize to me, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.013" end="00:33:15.013" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you supposed to apologize when</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.213" end="00:33:18.213" style="s2">you make a mistake?</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.013" end="00:33:20.313" style="s2">If you do something wrong,</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.213" end="00:33:23.313" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t you apologize?</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.313" end="00:33:26.613" style="s2">You taught me that.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.313" end="00:33:26.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy is so sorry, sweetie.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.213" end="00:33:40.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you jealous?</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.013" end="00:33:41.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What right do I have to be jealous?</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.013" end="00:33:44.213" style="s2">Me and little Bao never really belonged</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.613" end="00:33:44.213" style="s2">to her anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.413" end="00:33:48.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.913" end="00:33:50.013" style="s2">Be honest.</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.413" end="00:33:53.113" style="s2">If you&#39;re upset, you have to say it out</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.013" end="00:33:54.713" style="s2">loud. That&#39;s what you taught me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.113" end="00:33:56.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetie, [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.713" end="00:33:59.213" style="s2">such a good one.</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.613" end="00:34:00.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember every word you say, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.213" end="00:34:04.213" style="s2">But mommy wants to have a little chat</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.913" end="00:34:05.513" style="s2">with uncle alone. Is that okay with you?</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.213" end="00:34:08.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me have a quick word with him in</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.513" end="00:34:08.113" style="s2">private.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.313" end="00:34:13.813" style="s2">Justin, a word in private.</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.213" end="00:34:26.413" style="s2">What exactly is it that you want?</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.513" end="00:34:27.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe,</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.413" end="00:34:28.813" style="s2">can please not go.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.313" end="00:34:30.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was helping Zoe pick out a birthday</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.813" end="00:34:32.013" style="s2">gift for her father. I didn&#39;t refuse</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.513" end="00:34:34.313" style="s2">because I wanted to repay her for saving</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.013" end="00:34:36.513" style="s2">you. That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.313" end="00:34:38.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you telling me this?</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.513" end="00:34:39.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People have mouths. They need to speak</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.313" end="00:34:41.413" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.413" end="00:34:43.614" style="s2">I I understand that before.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.413" end="00:34:44.914" style="s2">It was little Bao who taught me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.614" end="00:34:49.414" style="s2">I&#39;ve already made things perfectly clear</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.914" end="00:34:49.414" style="s2">with Zoe. I am going to win you back.</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.783" end="00:34:52.804" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.614" end="00:34:57.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, the DNA results for you and the</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.414" end="00:34:57.914" style="s2">child are in.</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.914" end="00:35:04.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.114" end="00:35:13.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That brat, he gets annoyed just seeing</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.214" end="00:35:13.414" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.914" end="00:35:16.514" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.014" end="00:35:18.114" style="s2">Chloe,</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.514" end="00:35:19.214" style="s2">no matter who the little boy&#39;s father</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.114" end="00:35:20.414" style="s2">is,</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.214" end="00:35:25.414" style="s2">he is</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.414" end="00:35:25.414" style="s2">my good baby, my sweet grandson.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.114" end="00:35:32.414" style="s2">Chloe, just rest assured and stay here.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.714" end="00:35:34.414" style="s2">I&#39;ve raised you for all these years. You</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.414" end="00:35:36.414" style="s2">call me mom. You don&#39;t have to have</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.414" end="00:35:39.814" style="s2">anything to do with that boy. If someone</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.414" end="00:35:41.214" style="s2">has to leave, let him go.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.814" end="00:35:43.714" style="s2">Grandma is going to miss her little</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.214" end="00:35:45.014" style="s2">darling so much.</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.714" end="00:35:47.414" style="s2">And you&#39;re going to miss grandma too,</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.014" end="00:35:47.414" style="s2">aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.714" end="00:35:51.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Toby,</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.014" end="00:35:53.514" style="s2">what&#39;s going on? Was it you who switched</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.714" end="00:35:54.514" style="s2">the DNA results?</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.514" end="00:35:55.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me?</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.514" end="00:35:58.214" style="s2">Come on. I don&#39;t have that kind of</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.814" end="00:35:58.214" style="s2">power.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.414" end="00:36:02.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If not you, then Vincent.</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.714" end="00:36:13.214" style="s2">Hello, say something.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.614" end="00:36:14.114" style="s2">Did you let something slip</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.214" end="00:36:16.614" style="s2">to Vincent?</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.114" end="00:36:18.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, no, no. I don&#39;t think so.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.614" end="00:36:20.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Toby, you are just</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.714" end="00:36:23.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, um</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.514" end="00:36:23.314" style="s2">I got to go, Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.914" end="00:36:36.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro,</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.914" end="00:36:36.014" style="s2">I got kicked out by your aunt.</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.550" end="00:36:39.570" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.714" end="00:36:46.120" style="s2">Never thought I&#39;d see the day, bro.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.100" end="00:36:46.120" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.216" end="00:36:50.316" style="s2">I&#39;m going to win Chloe back.</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.516" end="00:36:53.216" style="s2">You have to help me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.416" end="00:37:02.416" style="s2">Bro, come over here. I got you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.616" end="00:37:05.016" style="s2">The key to all this is Zach.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.416" end="00:37:06.416" style="s2">If he actually accepts you as his dad,</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.016" end="00:37:07.916" style="s2">then you&#39;re already more than halfway</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.416" end="00:37:10.416" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.916" end="00:37:10.416" style="s2">Am I right?</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.316" end="00:37:15.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.316" end="00:37:16.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Chloe, this is the amount of</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.116" end="00:37:18.716" style="s2">paperwork Mr. Justin has to handle in a</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.916" end="00:37:19.916" style="s2">single day.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.716" end="00:37:22.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what&#39;s it doing with me?</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.916" end="00:37:23.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Justin has taken a leave of absence,</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.016" end="00:37:24.816" style="s2">so the company will be in your hands for</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.316" end="00:37:27.516" style="s2">the time being.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.816" end="00:37:27.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did he go?</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.616" end="00:37:30.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, listen.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.516" end="00:37:32.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So he just left the company like that?</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.616" end="00:37:33.416" style="s2">What&#39;s he taking leave for and when&#39;s he</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.316" end="00:37:34.816" style="s2">coming back?</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.416" end="00:37:35.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Justin says he&#39;s got something</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.816" end="00:37:37.816" style="s2">important to take care of.</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.916" end="00:37:39.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not going to talk anything to</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.816" end="00:37:41.416" style="s2">just Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.516" end="00:37:42.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your assistant now.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.416" end="00:37:45.316" style="s2">Mr. Justin&#39;s business, I don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.516" end="00:37:45.316" style="s2">anything about that.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.916" end="00:37:54.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.516" end="00:37:57.616" style="s2">Dressing like that to watch a kid, you</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.316" end="00:37:57.616" style="s2">can tell he has no idea what he&#39;s doing.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.116" end="00:38:02.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mister,</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.016" end="00:38:04.816" style="s2">I feel a bit embarrassed.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.916" end="00:38:06.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kidding me?</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.816" end="00:38:09.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.916" end="00:38:09.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.516" end="00:38:19.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.116" end="00:38:19.016" style="s2">I am absolutely exhausted.</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.616" end="00:38:27.416" style="s2">What on earth are you guys doing?</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.216" end="00:38:30.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy!</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.616" end="00:38:34.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Justin,</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.716" end="00:38:35.516" style="s2">this is what you called important?</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.616" end="00:38:37.616" style="s2">Playing with toys?</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.516" end="00:38:38.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not playing around. I&#39;m playing with</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.616" end="00:38:40.216" style="s2">Zach.</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.216" end="00:38:41.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle took me to the amusement park</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.216" end="00:38:42.716" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.016" end="00:38:44.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you having fun?</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.716" end="00:38:45.216" style="s2">Then how about you play with Mommy for a</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.116" end="00:38:45.617" style="s2">little bit?</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.216" end="00:38:48.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our race is</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.617" end="00:38:50.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; still on, baby. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.017" end="00:38:52.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zach. Zach, Zach.</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.717" end="00:38:53.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready. Three,</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.317" end="00:38:56.717" style="s2">two,</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.417" end="00:38:56.717" style="s2">one. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.517" end="00:39:00.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zach, Zach.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.317" end="00:39:07.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you trying to be my daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.617" end="00:39:11.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baby,</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.717" end="00:39:13.117" style="s2">don&#39;t you want me to be your dad?</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.717" end="00:39:15.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like you,</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.117" end="00:39:16.817" style="s2">but I don&#39;t want you to be my dad.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.317" end="00:39:19.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every time your mom sees you, she gets</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.817" end="00:39:20.517" style="s2">really sad.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.217" end="00:39:21.817" style="s2">Baby, I know I wasn&#39;t good to you</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.517" end="00:39:23.017" style="s2">before,</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.817" end="00:39:24.517" style="s2">but from now on, I&#39;ll take care of you</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.017" end="00:39:27.017" style="s2">and your mom.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.517" end="00:39:27.017" style="s2">I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.117" end="00:39:31.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, fine.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.417" end="00:39:37.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baby, can you teach me</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.417" end="00:39:37.017" style="s2">how do I get your mom to forgive me?</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.117" end="00:39:41.117" style="s2">Do you believe in the light?</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.817" end="00:39:45.417" style="s2">I&#39;ll buy you the newest Ultraman.</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.317" end="00:40:11.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What story are we reading?</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.317" end="00:40:17.317" style="s2">Why do you look so pale?</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.817" end="00:40:18.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.317" end="00:40:19.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to get you some medicine. Just</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.717" end="00:40:21.817" style="s2">wait here.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.517" end="00:40:23.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.817" end="00:40:26.117" style="s2">Baby&#39;s already asleep. I just head out</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.817" end="00:40:26.117" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.917" end="00:40:34.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You okay?</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.717" end="00:40:34.917" style="s2">You&#39;d better just sleep here.</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.417" end="00:40:41.217" style="s2">Let me get you some water.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.217" end="00:40:48.017" style="s2">Hey, wake up a little. Drink some water.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.918" end="00:40:57.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.918" end="00:40:57.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you forgive me?</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.518" end="00:41:05.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Justin, are you kidding me?</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.418" end="00:41:06.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zach said that</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.218" end="00:41:07.818" style="s2">when he was sick,</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.918" end="00:41:09.018" style="s2">you were the one who looked after him</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.818" end="00:41:10.918" style="s2">the most.</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.018" end="00:41:14.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He even gave you advice.</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.918" end="00:41:14.118" style="s2">An Ultraman bought him off.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.218" end="00:41:18.918" style="s2">Now look at you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.618" end="00:41:18.918" style="s2">Get out of here now.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.513" end="00:41:22.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.118" end="00:41:27.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, something&#39;s happened.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.618" end="00:41:31.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At this price, there&#39;s no way they can</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.018" end="00:41:32.618" style="s2">make any profit. Why are they moving in</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.718" end="00:41:34.018" style="s2">on this project?</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.618" end="00:41:35.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.018" end="00:41:36.918" style="s2">Half the projects we already secured got</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.718" end="00:41:39.718" style="s2">snatched up by them.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.918" end="00:41:41.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are these people?</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.718" end="00:41:43.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a foreign company. We don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.318" end="00:41:45.718" style="s2">anything about them.</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.918" end="00:41:47.368" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep a lid on the news first. Don&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.718" end="00:41:48.418" style="s2">it affect the stock.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.368" end="00:41:50.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.418" end="00:41:51.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s too late. Our stock is already</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.218" end="00:41:54.018" style="s2">crashing.</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.718" end="00:41:54.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.618" end="00:41:59.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is our overseas company.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.918" end="00:42:01.018" style="s2">Without my approval,</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.518" end="00:42:02.718" style="s2">how did we end up signing so many</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.018" end="00:42:04.918" style="s2">projects domestically at such low</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.718" end="00:42:06.718" style="s2">prices? Shut it down immediately and</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.918" end="00:42:09.718" style="s2">find out who&#39;s responsible.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.718" end="00:42:09.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to look into it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.018" end="00:42:12.918" style="s2">Yeah, I did it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.218" end="00:42:14.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here? Who said you</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.918" end="00:42:16.818" style="s2">could get involved in the company&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.318" end="00:42:16.818" style="s2">projects?</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.118" end="00:42:21.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad was happy I&#39;m back, so he threw a</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.818" end="00:42:22.918" style="s2">few projects my way to get me started.</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.318" end="00:42:24.618" style="s2">What&#39;s the problem?</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.918" end="00:42:26.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You being back doesn&#39;t make this company</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.618" end="00:42:27.818" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.018" end="00:42:29.618" style="s2">This company is not going to become your</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.818" end="00:42:31.318" style="s2">revenge tool against Justin.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.618" end="00:42:32.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said I was out for revenge? Are you</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.318" end="00:42:34.118" style="s2">just going to hand it over to Chloe?</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.718" end="00:42:37.218" style="s2">That&#39;s your problem.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.118" end="00:42:38.918" style="s2">But Justin, he&#39;s mine, only mine.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.218" end="00:42:41.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re underbidding Justin&#39;s company by</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.918" end="00:42:42.818" style="s2">a mile, way below what&#39;s fair.</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.618" end="00:42:44.618" style="s2">And you have the nerve to tell me it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.818" end="00:42:47.318" style="s2">not revenge, then what do you call it?</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.618" end="00:42:49.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those projects were just an appetizer.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.318" end="00:42:51.118" style="s2">What Justin cares about the most is his</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.218" end="00:42:52.818" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.118" end="00:42:55.120" style="s2">If you just help me,</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.818" end="00:42:57.020" style="s2">if you back me up on this,</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.120" end="00:42:58.720" style="s2">we can put so much pressure on Justin&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.020" end="00:42:59.720" style="s2">company that there&#39;s no way he and Chloe</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.720" end="00:43:01.920" style="s2">stay together.</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.720" end="00:43:04.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zoe,</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.920" end="00:43:04.820" style="s2">you&#39;ve lost your mind.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.220" end="00:43:10.720" style="s2">I&#39;m not helping you and I sure as hell</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.720" end="00:43:10.720" style="s2">won&#39;t sink to your level.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.620" end="00:43:16.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unscrupulous.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.520" end="00:43:18.920" style="s2">If it means pushing Chloe out and</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.520" end="00:43:21.720" style="s2">staying by Justin&#39;s side,</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.920" end="00:43:23.820" style="s2">I&#39;d burn this whole hotel to the ground.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.720" end="00:43:25.920" style="s2">It&#39;s just a few measly projects. Look at</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.820" end="00:43:27.920" style="s2">you, already losing it. Don&#39;t worry,</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.920" end="00:43:30.020" style="s2">brother. I still have plenty of tricks</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.920" end="00:43:30.420" style="s2">up my sleeve. Let me show you a thing or</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.020" end="00:43:32.020" style="s2">two.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.420" end="00:43:33.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of tricks?</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.020" end="00:43:35.520" style="s2">Hypnotizing Chloe and making her set a</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.720" end="00:43:36.920" style="s2">fire? That&#39;s your solution I never</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.520" end="00:43:39.420" style="s2">should have covered for you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.920" end="00:43:42.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hypnotized Chloe and made her set the</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.420" end="00:43:44.320" style="s2">fire. Got any proof?</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.220" end="00:43:46.220" style="s2">And besides,</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.320" end="00:43:47.920" style="s2">you&#39;re telling me you had no hidden</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.220" end="00:43:50.220" style="s2">jambition back then?</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.920" end="00:43:50.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.220" end="00:44:01.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s going down. Stay on him.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.920" end="00:44:03.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What good is filing a lawsuit?</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.320" end="00:44:04.320" style="s2">Look at how badly the company&#39;s stock</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.020" end="00:44:05.820" style="s2">has tanked.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.320" end="00:44:08.720" style="s2">Do you have any idea how much the</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.820" end="00:44:11.220" style="s2">company has lost these past few days?</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.720" end="00:44:13.120" style="s2">Exactly. By the time your lawsuit&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.220" end="00:44:13.720" style="s2">over, there won&#39;t even be a company</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.120" end="00:44:15.720" style="s2">left.</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.720" end="00:44:17.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, all right, everyone. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.720" end="00:44:19.720" style="s2">just take it easy.</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.720" end="00:44:21.820" style="s2">Mr. Justin has already hired the best</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.720" end="00:44:23.620" style="s2">legal team and they&#39;re moving forward</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.820" end="00:44:26.120" style="s2">with the lawsuit against that company.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.620" end="00:44:26.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.120" end="00:44:33.420" style="s2">Shut up all of you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.980" end="00:44:41.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.220" end="00:44:48.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Zoe,</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.520" end="00:44:50.220" style="s2">all of them turned against us,</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.920" end="00:44:53.120" style="s2">especially the one that just partners</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.220" end="00:44:53.920" style="s2">with Justin&#39;s company.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.120" end="00:44:54.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.920" end="00:44:57.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It looks like they&#39;ve built some</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.921" end="00:44:58.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; kind of product ecosystem. And they&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.021" end="00:45:02.121" style="s2">gotten those companies to sign some new</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.521" end="00:45:02.121" style="s2">agreement. So now they&#39;re basically</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.221" end="00:45:07.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, all these lawsuit documents are</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.921" end="00:45:11.621" style="s2">done. After this is over, I&#39;m definitely</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.921" end="00:45:13.521" style="s2">taking a long vacation.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.621" end="00:45:17.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, you&#39;ve been through so much.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.521" end="00:45:17.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not your honey. Don&#39;t say that.</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.556" end="00:45:24.921" style="s2">[sighs and gasps] How come I never</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.421" end="00:45:26.921" style="s2">noticed you were this shimless before?</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.921" end="00:45:30.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, Toby said if I&#39;m going to win you</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.921" end="00:45:30.921" style="s2">back, I can&#39;t afford to be shy.</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.721" end="00:45:34.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you always bringing up Toby and</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.321" end="00:45:37.521" style="s2">Zach? You&#39;re the boss. Can&#39;t you think</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.921" end="00:45:39.321" style="s2">for yourself for once?</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.521" end="00:45:41.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My only plan is to win you back.</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.321" end="00:45:43.421" style="s2">Everyone else is just backup. Once this</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.421" end="00:45:44.621" style="s2">is all over, let&#39;s go on a trip. You</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.421" end="00:45:47.521" style="s2">always said you wanted a road trip</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.621" end="00:45:50.621" style="s2">across Europe. We&#39;ll bring Zach.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.521" end="00:45:50.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young master sir.</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.321" end="00:45:57.621" style="s2">Zach&#39;s been taken.</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.121" end="00:45:58.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Mom, where&#39;s Zach? He&#39;s gone. Where</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.621" end="00:46:00.856" style="s2">is he?</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.621" end="00:46:02.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There were so many parents around.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.856" end="00:46:04.721" style="s2">[gasps] Zach was right there playing</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.921" end="00:46:07.221" style="s2">with the other kids.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.721" end="00:46:08.821" style="s2">I just turned around for 1 second and he</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.221" end="00:46:10.721" style="s2">was gone.</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.821" end="00:46:12.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, Chloe, don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.721" end="00:46:14.921" style="s2">I won&#39;t let anything happen to Zach.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.921" end="00:46:18.521" style="s2">I won&#39;t let anything happen to Zach.</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.921" end="00:46:18.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If anything happens to Zach,</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.121" end="00:46:22.121" style="s2">I won&#39;t survive it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.321" end="00:46:27.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, why don&#39;t you go upstairs and get</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.821" end="00:46:29.721" style="s2">some rest?</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.621" end="00:46:33.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I &#39;m not tired. I want to wait right</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.721" end="00:46:33.221" style="s2">here until my baby comes home.</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.321" end="00:46:37.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom&#39;s going to go make you something</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.621" end="00:46:37.321" style="s2">nice to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.921" end="00:46:43.121" style="s2">When Zach comes back, he&#39;s going to be</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.321" end="00:46:45.421" style="s2">worried sick if he sees you like this.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.121" end="00:46:48.221" style="s2">Just sit here and rest. I &#39;ll go make</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.421" end="00:46:48.221" style="s2">you something to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.221" end="00:46:58.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Chloe,</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.121" end="00:47:00.523" style="s2">do you want to save your son?</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.223" end="00:47:03.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you? How much do you want? I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.523" end="00:47:05.122" style="s2">give you anything. Just let my son go.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.122" end="00:47:07.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you call the police</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.122" end="00:47:10.922" style="s2">or bring anyone else,</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.823" end="00:47:10.922" style="s2">just wait.</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.723" end="00:47:19.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, who are you talking to?</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.922" end="00:47:19.523" style="s2">Chloe. Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.323" end="00:47:23.523" style="s2">Zach. Zach.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.323" end="00:47:27.323" style="s2">Baby.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.122" end="00:47:28.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Freeze.</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.323" end="00:47:30.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.023" end="00:47:30.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impressive memory you have there, Miss</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.023" end="00:47:33.223" style="s2">Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.823" end="00:47:35.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What exactly do you want from me?</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.223" end="00:47:37.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, Miss Chloe still keeps me in mind,</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.723" end="00:47:39.523" style="s2">then do you still remember my son?</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.723" end="00:47:41.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your boy brought all this on himself.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.523" end="00:47:45.057" style="s2">What right do you have to kidnap my son?</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.622" end="00:47:45.057" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HIS OWN FAULT. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.023" end="00:47:49.723" style="s2">HE&#39;S DEAD.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.823" end="00:47:51.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOM,</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.723" end="00:47:53.622" style="s2">how did Chloe run out by herself?</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.723" end="00:47:55.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have no idea. I went inside to make</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.622" end="00:47:57.523" style="s2">her something to eat, and when I came</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.422" end="00:47:59.323" style="s2">out, Chloe was gone.</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.523" end="00:48:00.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take it easy.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.323" end="00:48:03.122" style="s2">Think again. Did she say anything to you</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.823" end="00:48:04.023" style="s2">before?</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.122" end="00:48:06.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.023" end="00:48:08.122" style="s2">I heard her talking to someone.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.622" end="00:48:09.723" style="s2">Maybe she was on the phone with someone.</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.122" end="00:48:10.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it&#39;s not a random abduction. It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.723" end="00:48:12.922" style="s2">targeted kidnapping.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.922" end="00:48:15.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then think fast. Who have you people</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.922" end="00:48:15.622" style="s2">crossed?</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.922" end="00:48:19.622" style="s2">I&#39;m begging you, let my son go. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.523" end="00:48:21.622" style="s2">stay here instead. Do whatever you want</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.622" end="00:48:23.122" style="s2">to me. Kill me or torture me. Just let</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.622" end="00:48:24.823" style="s2">him go. Please. Just let him go.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.122" end="00:48:26.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want all of you dead.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.823" end="00:48:28.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They are not my love. Mother will shield</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.523" end="00:48:29.223" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.023" end="00:48:29.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe. Little Bow.</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.223" end="00:48:31.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Justin.</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.723" end="00:48:33.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Justin.</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.622" end="00:48:34.922" style="s2">I knew you&#39;d come.</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.523" end="00:48:35.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the one who hurt your son. Let the</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.922" end="00:48:38.023" style="s2">others go.</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.723" end="00:48:41.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife and my son both died because of</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.023" end="00:48:44.622" style="s2">you. If I kill you so easily,</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.523" end="00:48:46.523" style="s2">then wouldn&#39;t I lose everything?</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.622" end="00:48:48.723" style="s2">Watch the person you love most die right</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.523" end="00:48:51.723" style="s2">before your eyes. Only then can you be</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.723" end="00:48:54.622" style="s2">like me. I feel all your agony. Every</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.723" end="00:48:54.622" style="s2">last bit of it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.122" end="00:49:03.024" style="s2">Justin,</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.223" end="00:49:05.124" style="s2">you think still acting like some</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.024" end="00:49:07.324" style="s2">untouchable big shot CEO, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.124" end="00:49:09.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you dare hurt my son.</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.324" end="00:49:11.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop this. I won&#39;t lift a hand against</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.324" end="00:49:13.024" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.324" end="00:49:14.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Little about wake up. Don&#39;t scare mommy,</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.024" end="00:49:16.324" style="s2">my baby.</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.024" end="00:49:16.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grab him.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.724" end="00:49:19.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO!</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.724" end="00:49:19.824" style="s2">NO!</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.124" end="00:49:24.619" style="s2">NO!</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.599" end="00:49:24.619" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.724" end="00:49:32.224" style="s2">YOU MONSTER. MAY YOU ROT IN HELL.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.724" end="00:49:51.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calm down. You&#39;re badly hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.024" end="00:49:52.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.224" end="00:49:53.624" style="s2">Chloe, what are you doing here? Where</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.224" end="00:49:55.424" style="s2">are Chloe and little Bao?</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.624" end="00:49:56.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got all of them out safely.</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.424" end="00:49:57.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are they? I need to see them right</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.824" end="00:49:58.924" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.424" end="00:50:01.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to rush.</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.924" end="00:50:02.724" style="s2">I can&#39;t figure it out. Why is Chloe the</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.024" end="00:50:05.124" style="s2">only one you want?</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.724" end="00:50:05.124" style="s2">Justin,</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.224" end="00:50:10.124" style="s2">is there nothing in me worth your gaze?</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.624" end="00:50:12.024" style="s2">Please glance my way.</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.124" end="00:50:15.124" style="s2">My love for you began way before Chloe</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.024" end="00:50:15.124" style="s2">ever came into your life.</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.624" end="00:50:19.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got a problem with that?</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.305" end="00:50:38.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.524" end="00:50:39.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.024" end="00:50:42.824" style="s2">I&#39;ve been in love with you ever since</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.424" end="00:50:42.824" style="s2">you helped me 10 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.824" end="00:50:47.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t recall that person ever being</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.424" end="00:50:49.824" style="s2">you at all.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.724" end="00:50:50.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Step out of this door and I swear you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.824" end="00:50:52.624" style="s2">see the bodies of your children and</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.924" end="00:50:55.524" style="s2">Chloe instantly.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.624" end="00:50:55.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What have you done to them?</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.324" end="00:51:06.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them go, please.</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.425" end="00:51:09.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right then.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.825" end="00:51:11.425" style="s2">When will you fall in love with me?</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.525" end="00:51:12.825" style="s2">Be with me and I&#39;ll set them free</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.425" end="00:51:14.325" style="s2">whenever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.825" end="00:51:16.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zoe, I could never fall in love with</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.325" end="00:51:16.925" style="s2">you, not ever.</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.425" end="00:51:22.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Either do exactly as I say or you&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.025" end="00:51:24.925" style="s2">arranging their funerals.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.425" end="00:51:24.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zoe,</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.325" end="00:51:28.525" style="s2">let me tell you,</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.725" end="00:51:30.925" style="s2">if you dare hurt them,</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.525" end="00:51:32.325" style="s2">I&#39;ll make you pay dearly.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.925" end="00:51:36.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.325" end="00:51:37.325" style="s2">Then let them all die alongside me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.220" end="00:51:38.840" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.325" end="00:51:39.525" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.840" end="00:51:43.325" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.525" end="00:51:43.325" style="s2">I love you so deeply.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.080" end="00:51:47.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.625" end="00:51:49.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t force you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.425" end="00:51:51.625" style="s2">We can take our time to grow feelings</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.125" end="00:51:51.625" style="s2">for each other.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.725" end="00:51:57.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, I&#39;m so hungry and scared.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.725" end="00:51:59.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be scared, Bobby. Daddy will be</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.125" end="00:51:59.925" style="s2">safe as soon.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.825" end="00:52:05.925" style="s2">They&#39;ve got little Bobby&#39;s favorite</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.825" end="00:52:09.325" style="s2">thing,</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.925" end="00:52:12.925" style="s2">ice cream cake and lollipop.</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.325" end="00:52:12.925" style="s2">Sleep a little longer, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.925" end="00:52:25.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baby, baby,</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.925" end="00:52:26.425" style="s2">baby,</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.125" end="00:52:29.225" style="s2">baby,</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.425" end="00:52:29.225" style="s2">what&#39;s wrong with you?</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.276" end="00:52:32.725" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.925" end="00:52:35.025" style="s2">Baby, don&#39;t scare mommy, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.725" end="00:52:35.025" style="s2">Baby,</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.725" end="00:52:38.825" style="s2">don&#39;t scare mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.525" end="00:52:45.725" style="s2">Is anyone there? Please save my child.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.325" end="00:52:48.271" style="s2">He&#39;s unconscious. Somebody help me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.725" end="00:52:49.725" style="s2">Anyone, please.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.271" end="00:52:50.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.725" end="00:52:53.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve already shown you surveillance</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.925" end="00:52:56.325" style="s2">footage. Can we rest together now?</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.525" end="00:52:56.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Need to see them.</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.725" end="00:53:02.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re in no position to negotiate terms</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.725" end="00:53:05.527" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.825" end="00:53:07.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you take me for a fool?</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.527" end="00:53:08.827" style="s2">Three days. The surveillance footage</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.527" end="00:53:10.827" style="s2">you&#39;ve been showing me is always the</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.827" end="00:53:12.127" style="s2">exact same scene.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.827" end="00:53:14.527" style="s2">I don&#39;t even know if they&#39;re alive or</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.127" end="00:53:14.527" style="s2">dead.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.327" end="00:53:19.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me see them.</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.227" end="00:53:22.027" style="s2">Otherwise, I have no idea what I might</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.627" end="00:53:22.027" style="s2">do.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.927" end="00:53:26.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kill me. Let the mother and son die</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.727" end="00:53:29.127" style="s2">alongside me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.927" end="00:53:31.327" style="s2">I&#39;ve got nothing to lose.</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.127" end="00:53:33.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie, don&#39;t worry. No one can vanish</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.327" end="00:53:35.727" style="s2">into thin air.</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.027" end="00:53:38.327" style="s2">We&#39;re bound to find some clues.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.727" end="00:53:40.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s been two days already.</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.327" end="00:53:43.127" style="s2">Justin has been taken prisoner, yet</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.627" end="00:53:45.527" style="s2">there&#39;s not a trace of him to be found.</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.127" end="00:53:47.527" style="s2">I&#39;m just scared.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.527" end="00:53:49.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it can&#39;t be true.</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.527" end="00:53:50.827" style="s2">It can&#39;t be true. No way.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.842" end="00:53:53.527" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.827" end="00:53:55.627" style="s2">I have no clue. It was some woman. She</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.527" end="00:53:57.627" style="s2">said she&#39;d help me get revenge. All I</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.627" end="00:54:01.227" style="s2">had to do was kill Chloe and her son,</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.627" end="00:54:02.527" style="s2">and she&#39;d pay me a huge sum of money.</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.227" end="00:54:05.227" style="s2">Who on earth would target Justin and</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.527" end="00:54:05.227" style="s2">little Bobby?</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.872" end="00:54:08.892" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.227" end="00:54:12.727" style="s2">Someone&#39;s outside. She claimed she knew</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.527" end="00:54:13.827" style="s2">where the young master and madam were</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.727" end="00:54:15.327" style="s2">hiding.</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.827" end="00:54:18.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who exactly was she?</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.327" end="00:54:18.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Justin.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.007" end="00:54:20.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.827" end="00:54:21.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to ask you one final time.</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.727" end="00:54:25.727" style="s2">Where the hell are they?</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.927" end="00:54:25.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I honestly don&#39;t know their whereabouts.</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.027" end="00:54:30.527" style="s2">I only know something about Chloe last</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.327" end="00:54:33.627" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.527" end="00:54:37.527" style="s2">Banging on the door, begging for mercy,</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.627" end="00:54:37.527" style="s2">begging me to save her child.</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.527" end="00:54:41.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll die together then.</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.792" end="00:54:50.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.127" end="00:54:54.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Found them.</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.227" end="00:54:57.307" style="s2">Found them. Found them. I&#39;ve located</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.927" end="00:54:59.227" style="s2">them at last.</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.307" end="00:55:02.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.227" end="00:55:04.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re alive.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.027" end="00:55:05.827" style="s2">You&#39;re actually alive.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.727" end="00:55:07.428" style="s2">Vince,</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.827" end="00:55:09.328" style="s2">you&#39;re still breathing. I never thought</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.428" end="00:55:11.928" style="s2">you&#39;d live.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.328" end="00:55:11.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.828" end="00:55:20.328" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. She out of critical</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.428" end="00:55:22.328" style="s2">condition, but it&#39;ll take some time</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.328" end="00:55:24.328" style="s2">before she wakes up.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.328" end="00:55:27.228" style="s2">Trapped for days without food plus heavy</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.328" end="00:55:29.428" style="s2">blood loss. Lost too much blood.</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.228" end="00:55:32.328" style="s2">Bobby&#39;s body gave out</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.428" end="00:55:35.428" style="s2">and he slipped into unconsciousness.</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.328" end="00:55:35.428" style="s2">She used her own blood.</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.828" end="00:55:42.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bobby.</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.428" end="00:55:42.828" style="s2">Bobby.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.328" end="00:55:48.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be scared. Everything&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.128" end="00:55:49.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Bobby? Where&#39;s Bobby?</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.028" end="00:55:50.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bobby Bobby is fine now.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.428" end="00:55:52.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about Bobby?</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.228" end="00:55:54.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bobby&#39;s fine. Bobby&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.828" end="00:55:56.428" style="s2">Mom&#39;s taking care of him.</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.628" end="00:55:57.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to go to him right now. Can you</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.428" end="00:56:01.128" style="s2">confirm he&#39;s okay?</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.628" end="00:56:01.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom&#39;s taking he&#39;s fine him.</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.428" end="00:56:08.728" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Chloe. It&#39;s all behind us</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.428" end="00:56:08.728" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.928" end="00:56:13.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Senior, your leg.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.628" end="00:56:16.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s broken.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.728" end="00:56:19.828" style="s2">My little sister did this.</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.928" end="00:56:23.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your sister, senior?</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.828" end="00:56:25.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zoe is my biological younger sister.</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.113" end="00:56:25.133" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.428" end="00:56:28.928" style="s2">She was abducted when she was little.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.728" end="00:56:34.928" style="s2">She wasn&#39;t found until she was nearly an</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.328" end="00:56:34.928" style="s2">adult.</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.328" end="00:56:39.328" style="s2">She wants to keep living under Zoe&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.728" end="00:56:39.328" style="s2">identity.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.828" end="00:56:43.828" style="s2">Out of guilt, the family didn&#39;t stop</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.628" end="00:56:43.828" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.428" end="00:56:47.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you two are siblings, why would</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.528" end="00:56:49.128" style="s2">she hurt you?</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.628" end="00:56:50.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She hired someone to run me over on the</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.128" end="00:56:54.228" style="s2">road because I intended to tell you the</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.528" end="00:56:54.228" style="s2">truth about the fire seven years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.928" end="00:57:00.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fire? What truth?</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.128" end="00:57:02.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Justin nearly died in a big fire seven</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.128" end="00:57:05.928" style="s2">years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.128" end="00:57:08.528" style="s2">All the evidence points to the arsonist.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.928" end="00:57:08.528" style="s2">It&#39;s you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.828" end="00:57:12.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me?</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.728" end="00:57:15.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.029" end="00:57:16.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; indeed the one who set the fire.</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.329" end="00:57:17.429" style="s2">But it was you who was hypnotized by</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.729" end="00:57:20.229" style="s2">Zoe.</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.429" end="00:57:20.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hypnosis.</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.829" end="00:57:24.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zoe saw that you stuck close to Chloe</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.629" end="00:57:25.929" style="s2">all the time and paid no attention to</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.229" end="00:57:27.429" style="s2">her. She took advantage of Chloe&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.929" end="00:57:29.529" style="s2">sleepwalking disorder and asked a</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.429" end="00:57:31.029" style="s2">hypnotist to hypnotize her into setting</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.529" end="00:57:32.229" style="s2">the fire.</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.029" end="00:57:34.029" style="s2">Then she rushed into the burning</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.229" end="00:57:37.129" style="s2">building to save you,</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.029" end="00:57:37.129" style="s2">which left her infertile.</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.929" end="00:57:41.629" style="s2">She did all of this just to drive Chloe</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.529" end="00:57:44.229" style="s2">away</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.629" end="00:57:46.129" style="s2">and stay by your side.</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.229" end="00:57:49.229" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry, Chloe. By the time I found</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.129" end="00:57:49.229" style="s2">out, everything had already happened.</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.929" end="00:57:55.829" style="s2">But because of my selfishness, I never</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.329" end="00:57:55.829" style="s2">told you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.729" end="00:58:00.129" style="s2">Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.429" end="00:58:06.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Justin.</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.329" end="00:58:07.729" style="s2">So the reason you filed for divorce from</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.129" end="00:58:09.429" style="s2">me,</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.729" end="00:58:11.429" style="s2">it&#39;s cuz you thought I want to seize the</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.429" end="00:58:14.529" style="s2">Lu family&#39;s Ty friend, shove the fire to</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.429" end="00:58:14.529" style="s2">kill you and take your life.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.129" end="00:58:19.929" style="s2">Zoe rushed in to save you and become in</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.929" end="00:58:21.929" style="s2">for you, so you want to take care for</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.929" end="00:58:23.529" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.929" end="00:58:26.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know how crazy that woman is? And</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.529" end="00:58:26.129" style="s2">what about Shaken?</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.829" end="00:58:30.629" style="s2">Chloe, you&#39;re awake.</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.829" end="00:58:33.929" style="s2">What are you guys doing?</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.829" end="00:58:35.329" style="s2">Go on.</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.929" end="00:58:36.729" style="s2">What about Shaken&#39;s death?</p>
