<p begin="00:58:40.729" end="00:58:46.029" style="s2">what&#39;s more, even Furthen&#39;s wife, her</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.529" end="00:58:46.729" style="s2">suicide was also incited by her.</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.029" end="00:58:48.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.729" end="00:58:49.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you&#39;re the only sensible one left in</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.129" end="00:58:50.529" style="s2">your family. Your parents are still</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.229" end="00:58:51.929" style="s2">hiring lawyers for her.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.529" end="00:58:52.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe,</p>
