<p begin="00:59:04.429" end="00:59:07.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with you two? What&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.829" end="00:59:08.629" style="s2">on between you?</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.229" end="00:59:09.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Toby,</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.629" end="00:59:13.029" style="s2">did you know your brother nearly got</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.729" end="00:59:13.029" style="s2">burnt to death seven years ago?</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.431" end="00:59:17.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I know.</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.431" end="00:59:18.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the one who set that fire.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.231" end="00:59:20.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What nonsense are you talking about? It</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.931" end="00:59:22.231" style="s2">was just an accident. Wo does it have to</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.931" end="00:59:24.131" style="s2">do with you? Did you hit your head and</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.231" end="00:59:27.131" style="s2">hurt your brain?</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.131" end="00:59:28.531" style="s2">even if I saw you set that fire,</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.131" end="00:59:30.131" style="s2">I can&#39;t believe you wanted to hurt my</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.531" end="00:59:32.531" style="s2">brother either.</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.131" end="00:59:34.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.531" end="00:59:37.131" style="s2">Toby trusts me instinctively and</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.631" end="00:59:39.331" style="s2">unconditionally. What about you?</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.131" end="00:59:40.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even he can trust me unconditionally.</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.331" end="00:59:43.031" style="s2">What about you?</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.131" end="00:59:43.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me explain.</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.331" end="00:59:47.731" style="s2">Chloe,</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.831" end="00:59:52.031" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.631" end="00:59:54.031" style="s2">I was too conceited.</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.031" end="00:59:57.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I originally thought you treated me this</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.031" end="00:59:57.931" style="s2">way because you had someone you liked.</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.931" end="01:00:03.431" style="s2">But I never imagined it was because you</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.731" end="01:00:05.231" style="s2">didn&#39;t trust me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.431" end="01:00:07.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe,</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.231" end="01:00:10.431" style="s2">I didn&#39;t figure out my feelings until</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.031" end="01:00:10.431" style="s2">you left three years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.631" end="01:00:15.731" style="s2">I I don&#39;t want to lose you again.</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.731" end="01:00:17.131" style="s2">I never bothered digging into the truth</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.731" end="01:00:18.531" style="s2">of what happened seven years ago</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.131" end="01:00:20.431" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.531" end="01:00:23.131" style="s2">Even if you once truly intended to hurt</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.431" end="01:00:26.431" style="s2">me, I no longer care.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.131" end="01:00:26.431" style="s2">All I want is to be with you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.931" end="01:00:34.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand your doubts about me. Yet,</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.331" end="01:00:34.531" style="s2">I can&#39;t accept them.</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.231" end="01:00:41.931" style="s2">Justin, let&#39;s get divorced.</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.231" end="01:00:45.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.431" end="01:00:49.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, it&#39;s your turn. Hurry up. Hurry</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.431" end="01:00:52.131" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.731" end="01:00:54.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy!</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.131" end="01:00:56.431" style="s2">Mom, you</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.131" end="01:00:59.731" style="s2">don&#39;t leave my dad behind. Hope you two</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.431" end="01:00:59.731" style="s2">stay happy together.</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.131" end="01:01:02.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not your dad. Stop talking</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.631" end="01:01:04.731" style="s2">nonsense. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.731" end="01:01:08.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not making this up. You and God</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.731" end="01:01:08.231" style="s2">Vander definitely said that.</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.331" end="01:01:12.331" style="s2">Justin is my biological father.</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.931" end="01:01:18.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I got it wrong. My bad. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.532" end="01:01:21.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just a kid,</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.332" end="01:01:23.632" style="s2">but I&#39;m no silly kid.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.232" end="01:01:27.932" style="s2">How many times have you said this? Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.632" end="01:01:29.032" style="s2">let Dad find me. I remember everything.</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.932" end="01:01:30.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe,</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.032" end="01:01:33.432" style="s2">tell me the truth. Chloe, tell me the</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.932" end="01:01:33.432" style="s2">truth.</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.132" end="01:01:38.932" style="s2">Speak.</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.332" end="01:01:39.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, it&#39;s your son.</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.932" end="01:01:42.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what?</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.632" end="01:01:42.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your son.</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.732" end="01:01:46.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I could have whole game, but don&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.932" end="01:01:50.232" style="s2">think some get of a baby.</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.532" end="01:01:50.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I can hear you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.032" end="01:01:54.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baby, if you have to pick only one</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.132" end="01:01:56.932" style="s2">between mom and dad.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.932" end="01:01:58.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want both of you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.932" end="01:01:59.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree.</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.332" end="01:02:01.632" style="s2">Wait till you get discharged from the</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.732" end="01:02:04.632" style="s2">hospital. Let&#39;s head straight to the</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.632" end="01:02:04.632" style="s2">Civil Affairs Bureau.</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.132" end="01:02:11.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, how long will it take to remarry?</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.432" end="01:02:14.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make an appointment online. Everything</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.932" end="01:02:14.932" style="s2">can be done on the internet.</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.732" end="01:02:18.132" style="s2">See you tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.332" end="01:02:21.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come quickly.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.132" end="01:02:21.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine, baby.</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.632" end="01:02:28.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe,</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.632" end="01:02:30.832" style="s2">Chloe, right now we&#39;re both free,</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.232" end="01:02:30.832" style="s2">unmarried.</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.332" end="01:02:38.732" style="s2">Can I pursue you all over again?</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
